 ```
 
-Cancellation is not yet exposed; when it is added, bookings cancelled less than 24 hours before their
-start will receive no refund, and all other cancellations will receive a full refund.
+Use `cancel(bookingId, at)` to cancel a booking at a whole UTC hour. It returns the booking id and
+refund in euro cents, releases the equipment immediately, and cannot be repeated. Cancellations made
+less than 24 hours before the booking starts receive no refund; cancelling exactly 24 hours before or
+earlier receives the booking's full (including any discount) total:
+
+```ts
+rentals.cancel('booking-1', '2026-06-09T00:00:00Z');
+// { bookingId: 'booking-1', refund: 6750 }
+```
